and plipe (leap) seem to involve motion, and another 3 could be
related: benji (transfer), fanva (translate), mrilu (mail).

bevri, benji and mrilu have parallel structures, but the other three
have their own.

The most unexpcted 5 place gismu was {santa}, which means "umbrella".

